B.a1x=new A.hF("The Day of Arafah","For those not on Hajj: fasting today expiates the year before and the year after. And pour out dua \u2014 it is the best day of the year for it.","Sahih Muslim 1162 \xb7 Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 3585")
