B.Vd=new A.bx(u.v,"Aisha (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6464")
B.Vj=new A.bx("Cleanliness is half of faith.","Abu Malik al-Ash\u2019ari (RA)","Sahih Muslim 223")
B.V1=new A.bx("Whoever conceals the fault of a Muslim, Allah will conceal his faults in this world and the Hereafter.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2699")
B.V8=new A.bx("The upper hand is better than the lower hand.","Abdullah ibn Umar (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 1427")
B.Vq=new A.bx("Make things easy and do not make them difficult; give glad tidings and do not repel people.","Anas ibn Malik (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 69")
B.UE=new A.bx("The best charity is that given when you are healthy and holding back, fearing poverty.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 1419")
B.UV=new A.bx("Whoever does not show mercy will not be shown mercy.","Jarir ibn Abdullah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6013")
B.Vp=new A.bx("Kindness is never present in anything but it beautifies it.","Aisha (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2594")
B.UG=new A.bx("Removing something harmful from the road is charity.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 2989")
B.UQ=new A.bx("A good word is charity.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 2989")
B.Vy=new A.bx("Two words, light on the tongue, heavy on the Scale, beloved to the Most Merciful: SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi, SubhanAllahil-Adheem.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6406")
B.Vw=new A.bx("Whoever believes in Allah and the Last Day, let him honor his guest.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6019")
B.UI=new A.bx("The most complete believers in faith are the best of them in character.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 1162 \u2014 sahih")
B.Vg=new A.bx("Fear Allah wherever you are, follow a bad deed with a good one and it will erase it, and treat people with good character.","Abu Dharr & Mu\u2019adh (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 1987 \u2014 hasan sahih")
B.V4=new A.bx("Allah does not look at your appearances or your wealth, but He looks at your hearts and your deeds.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2564")
B.V2=new A.bx("Leave that which makes you doubt for that which does not make you doubt.","al-Hasan ibn Ali (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 2518 \u2014 hasan sahih")
B.UN=new A.bx("Part of a person\u2019s good Islam is leaving what does not concern him.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 2317 \u2014 hasan")
B.Vf=new A.bx("Do not envy one another, do not hate one another, do not turn away from one another \u2014 and be, O servants of Allah, brothers.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2559 \u2014 excerpt")
B.V0=new A.bx("A Muslim is the brother of a Muslim: he does not wrong him, nor forsake him, nor despise him.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2564")
B.Vc=new A.bx("Whoever relieves a believer\u2019s distress, Allah will relieve his distress on the Day of Resurrection.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2699 \u2014 excerpt")
B.Vk=new A.bx("Be in this world as if you were a stranger or a traveler.","Abdullah ibn Umar (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6416")
B.Ve=new A.bx("If you were to rely upon Allah with true reliance, He would provide for you as He provides for the birds.","Umar ibn al-Khattab (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 2344 \u2014 hasan sahih")
B.Vz=new A.bx("Take advantage of five before five: your youth before your old age, your health before your sickness, your wealth before your poverty, your free time before your busyness, and your life before your death.","Abdullah ibn Abbas (RA)","al-Hakim \u2014 sahih")
B.Vo=new A.bx("The best among you are those who are best to their families, and I am the best of you to my family.","Aisha (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 3895 \u2014 sahih")
B.UP=new A.bx("He is not of us who does not show mercy to our young and honor our elderly.","Abdullah ibn Amr (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 1919 \u2014 sahih")
B.Vn=new A.bx("The Merciful are shown mercy by the Most Merciful; be merciful to those on earth and the One above the heavens will be merciful to you.","Abdullah ibn Amr (RA)","Sunan Abi Dawud 4941 \u2014 sahih")
B.Vv=new A.bx(u.Y,"Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sunan Abi Dawud 4811 \u2014 sahih")
B.UK=new A.bx(u.d,"Abdullah ibn Abbas (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6412")
B.V6=new A.bx("Richness is not having many possessions; richness is contentment of the soul.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 6446")
B.V_=new A.bx("The most beloved people to Allah are those most beneficial to people.","Ibn Umar (RA)","al-Mu\u2019jam al-Awsat \u2014 hasan")
B.Vx=new A.bx("Allah makes the way to Paradise easy for whoever travels a path seeking knowledge.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2699 \u2014 excerpt")
B.Vh=new A.bx("When a man dies, his deeds end except three: ongoing charity, beneficial knowledge, or a righteous child who prays for him.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 1631")
B.V9=new A.bx("The best of you in this world are those who, when they are reminded of Allah, their eyes overflow with tears.","Abdullah ibn Mas\u2019ud (RA)","Musnad Ahmad \u2014 meaning, graded hasan")
B.VA=new A.bx("Whoever fasts Ramadan out of faith and hope for reward, his previous sins are forgiven.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 38")
B.UW=new A.bx("Whoever prays the two cool hours (Fajr and Asr) will enter Paradise.","Abu Musa al-Ash\u2019ari (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 574")
B.Vm=new A.bx("The closest a servant is to his Lord is while he is prostrating \u2014 so make much dua.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 482")
B.V7=new A.bx("Allah descends in the last third of the night and says: Who calls upon Me that I may answer him?","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 1145 \u2014 excerpt")
B.Vs=new A.bx("Purity of speech and feeding others and praying at night while people sleep \u2014 enter Paradise in peace.","Abdullah ibn Salam (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 2485 \u2014 sahih, excerpt")
B.Vl=new A.bx("The seven whom Allah will shade on the day there is no shade but His\u2026 (among them) a person whose eyes shed tears in private out of reverence for Allah.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 660 \u2014 excerpt")
B.UT=new A.bx("Whoever says SubhanAllah one hundred times, a thousand good deeds are recorded for him.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2698")
B.UY=new A.bx("Indeed Allah and His angels send blessings upon the Prophet; O you who believe, send blessings and peace upon him.","The Quran itself commands it","Quran 33:56")
B.UH=new A.bx("Whoever sends one blessing upon me, Allah sends ten blessings upon him.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 407")
B.UZ=new A.bx("There is a gate in Paradise called Ar-Rayyan through which those who fasted will enter, and none will enter through it except them.","Sahl ibn Sa\u2019d (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 1896")
B.UJ=new A.bx("Allah accepts the repentance of His servant so long as the death-rattle has not reached his throat.","Abdullah ibn Umar (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 3537 \u2014 hasan")
B.Vr=new A.bx("By the One in Whose hand is my soul, if you did not sin, Allah would replace you with people who would sin and seek forgiveness \u2014 and He would forgive them.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2749")
B.UU=new A.bx(u.J,"Anas ibn Malik (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 2499 \u2014 hasan")
B.Va=new A.bx("Allah is happier with the repentance of His servant than one of you who finds his lost camel in the desert.","Anas ibn Malik (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2747 \u2014 excerpt")
B.UL=new A.bx(u.P,"Jabir ibn Abdullah (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2877")
B.Vi=new A.bx("Amazing is the affair of the believer \u2014 all of it is good for him: gratitude in ease, patience in hardship.","Suhayb ar-Rumi (RA)","Sahih Muslim 2999 \u2014 excerpt")
B.V3=new A.bx("No fatigue, illness, worry or grief touches a Muslim, even the prick of a thorn, but that Allah expiates some of his sins by it.","Abu Hurayrah (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 5641 \u2014 excerpt")
B.Vu=new A.bx(u.N,"Usamah ibn Zayd (RA)","Sahih al-Bukhari 1284 \u2014 excerpt")
B.Vt=new A.bx("Supplication is worship itself.","an-Nu\u2019man ibn Bashir (RA)","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 2969 \u2014 sahih")
B.UX=new A.bx("The dua of the distressed: O Allah, Your mercy I hope for \u2014 do not leave me to myself even for the blink of an eye.","Asma bint Umays (RA)","Sunan Abi Dawud 5090 \u2014 sahih")
