B.Y7=new A.dy("Dua","La ilaha illa anta, subhanaka, inni kuntu minaz-zalimin \u2014 the dua of Yunus in the three darknesses.","Quran 21:87 \xb7 Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 3505")
