B.Yh=new A.dy("Hadith","When one of you becomes angry, let him say: A\u2019udhu billahi minash-shaytanir-rajim.","Sahih al-Bukhari 6115 \u2014 meaning")
B.Y8=new A.dy("Hadith","Anger comes from Shaytan, and Shaytan was created from fire \u2014 and fire is extinguished with water. So when one of you becomes angry, let him make wudu.","Sunan Abi Dawud 4784 \u2014 sahih")
